  "core_distinctions_vs_bzac189": {
    "1_zero_caption_clean_screen_option": "FailSide Moment #290 uses ZERO text captions during the entire intro (0.00s..16.08s) so the viewer's eye locks 100% onto the rapid-fire physical action. (When adapted to ITV Moments, can either run Clean-Screen or use compact V8 Komika Axis with Caption Blanking).",
    "2_hyper_15_clip_density": "Packs 15 distinct clips into 16.08s (mean 1.07s/clip; middle 13 clips are 0.53s..0.90s each = 13f..21f @ 23.976fps), creating a 30% faster visual cut rate than Bzac New #189.",
    "3_nature_shock_cold_open_347s": "Clip #1 (0.00s..3.47s) is a 3.47s force-of-nature shock clip: 1.80s calm palm trees under 'Hello everyone!' -> 1.67s massive lightning bolt striking the palm tree at 1.97s with blinding white flash + camera drop -> Impact Cross Zoom at 3.47s.",
    "4_camera_hit_snowboard_finale_250s": "Final Teaser #15 (13.58s..16.08s, 2.50s) is a direct-into-lens collision: 1.06s snowboarder approaching camera under 'Let's dive right in!' (13.14s..14.64s) -> 1.44s unmasked crash gap where the snowboarder slams directly into the cameraman at 15.60s..16.08s (Peak -2.0 dB).",
    "5_acoustic_vacuum_ember_warning_card": "During the WARNING! card (16.08s..17.72s, 1.64s with animated fire embers), audio drops to near-total silence (-37 dB to -68 dB) — creating an acoustic vacuum before Body Clip #1 hits.",
    "6_heavy_vehicle_ escalation_at_body_start": "Instead of replaying an intro clip at Body Clip #1, FailSide Moment opens the main body (17.72s..35.0s) with 3 consecutive brand-new heavy-vehicle/industrial disasters (runaway dump truck crashing parked cars -> raised dump bed hitting highway gantry -> semi-truck wind rollover)."
  },
